[signal arg="CONVOSTART"]
CharlieBones: Good nevermourne, Virtue
CharlieBones: right now you're looking for your clients. They should be waiting for you somewhere around by the hallway.
if {ClaudTalkedTo} == true:
	CharlieBones: Thanks for telling Claudma about the mist, hehe
	Virtue: How could you know that?
	CharlieBones: I just do.
	CharlieBones: now I like you, so I gotta give you a heads up.
	CharlieBones: the next "Clients" gonna be tough to talk to...
	CharlieBones: Tell them about the "Solar Marker" and they'll understand what you say
	Virtue: Is that his favourite movie or something?
	CharlieBones: No, but trust me on this. They''ll get it.
	set {BonestoZIPH} = true
	jump CharlieConvo
else:
	label CharlieConvo
	- Who are you?
		CharlieBones: Just some bones.
		CharlieBones: ...
		jump CharlieConvo
	- Are you my client?
		CharlieBones: 'fraid not.
		jump CharlieConvo
	- (Leave Conversation)
		if {ClaudTalkedTo} == false:
			CharlieBones: If you could do me a favor? tell Claudma about the lovley mist outside...
			CharlieBones: very lovley...
			(I have no clue who Claudma is, but this odd fellow seems to look fondly upon them)
			[signal arg="CONVOISOVER"]
			set {Charlie1Interact} = false
			set {ChToCla} = true
			[end_timeline]
		CharlieBones: Good talk
		[signal arg="CONVOISOVER"]
		set {Charlie1Interact} = false
		[end_timeline]